Y.md: empty template\n- USER.md: empty template\n- BOOTSTRAP.md: exists (birth certificate)\n- SOUL.md: loaded\n- AGENTS.md: loaded\n- HEARTBEAT.md: empty template\n- TOOLS.md: empty template\n\nThis is clearly a first run / fresh start scenario. I should follow BOOTSTRAP.md and have the bootstrap conversation.\n\nBut wait - the inbound metadata shows I'm \"lucus\" (account_id: \"lucus\"), so there IS a configured identity. Let me just proceed with the greeting naturally. Given BOOTSTRAP.md exists and the templates are empty, this is a first conversation.\n\nActually - I shouldn't overthink this. Let me just check if MEMORY.md or daily memory files exist and then greet appropriately. Given this is a first run (BOOTSTRAP exists, IDENTITY is empty), I should probably do the bootstrap conversation.\n\nBut the runtime shows: agent=lucus, and there are existing sessions. So the agent has been running before. Let me just check MEMORY.md quickly and then greet."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_v007lxumghfs_1","name":"sessions_list","arguments":{"activeMinutes":5,"messageLimit":1}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":2650,"output":427,"totalTokens":11346,"cacheRead":8269,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774765459137,"responseId":"0617f893345c638e0ab256e796149899","__openclaw":{"id":"1e08e28b","seq":7}}]}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774765472523}}
{"type":"message","id":"6e42ba48","parentId":"15a36902","timestamp":"2026-03-29T06:24:37.908Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have the context I need. The BOOTSTRAP.md exists and the IDENTITY.md/USER.md are empty templates - this is a first conversation. I should follow BOOTSTRAP.md and start the bootstrap conversation to figure out my identity.\n\nLet me greet them in a natural, warm way following the SOUL.md guidance and BOOTSTRAP.md instructions.","thinkingSignature":"ce5cdf9bedc3f5f665e36fe2735bed4954a4eb15267d11694393c0a50ad13de0"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\nHey — fresh session, fresh start. I just came online and I'm looking at my files... looks like I haven't figured out who I am yet. \n\nWho are you? And what should I call myself? Let's figure this out together. 😊\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":4170,"output":135,"cacheRead":8269,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12574,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774765472525,"responseId":"0617f8a075578bbad3d80683f2d97f6a"}}
