y accessible to me directly, rather than trying to spawn subagents that clearly don't have the right capabilities.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"抱歉，我反复尝试读取文档但一直没拿到内容——看起来当前环境下子代理无法正常访问飞书工具。\n\n能麻烦你把文档里 ECHO 协议的接口内容直接贴过来吗？或者导出成文本发给我也行。拿到接口定义后我可以马上开始设计 Agent 集成方案和 React 项目。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/auto","usage":{"input":22195,"output":1490,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23685,"cost":{"input":-22195,"output":-1490,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":-23685}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774766141907,"responseId":"gen-1774766142-onMqBBTDU7h3WO8yZzvx"}}
