{"type":"message","id":"609eb905","parentId":"11a6bb6a","timestamp":"2026-03-29T06:40:12.582Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nI can see the subagent is running but the messages array is empty, meaning it hasn't sent any responses yet. Let me wait a bit more for it to complete, and also check if there are any child sessions that might have completed.\n\nLooking at the child sessions list, I can see multiple subagents have been spawned but none seem to have completed successfully based on the empty messages array.\n\nLet me wait a bit more and then check again.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"子代理正在运行中，让我等一下看看结果：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_521130a466f54acc86e40760","name":"sessions_history","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:lucus:subagent:08c006fc-c071-4af6-8a95-9e05b5a1ba33","limit":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/free","usage":{"input":22058,"output":252,"cacheRead":43,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22353,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774766389762,"responseId":"gen-1774766389-4sazZI8ikeKl3XTVAFzj"}}
