node/.openclaw/openclaw.json`或`/etc/openclaw/config.yaml`）中，添加以下内容：\n\n```json\n\"providers\": {\n  \"scnet\": {\n    \"models\": [\n      \"MiniMax-M2.5\",\n      \"DeepSeek-V3.2\",\n      \"Qwen3-235B-A22B\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n或者通过OpenClaw CLI添加：\n```bash\nopenclaw config set providers.scnet.models \"MiniMax-M2.5,DeepSeek-V3.2,Qwen3-235B-A22B\"\n```\n\n添加后重启OpenClaw服务即可生效。需要确认SCNet平台的API密钥已正确配置在`~/.openclaw/openclaw.json`的`scnet`配置下。\n</final>"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/free","usage":{"input":26614,"output":981,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27595,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774768812783,"responseId":"gen-1774768812-LANCn4EDSk2IunDPFEEZ"}}
