{"type":"message","id":"e35ab2c3","parentId":"205a3eb2","timestamp":"2026-03-29T07:21:10.671Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Okay, let me try to figure out how to help the user add the SCNet models to OpenClaw. The user mentioned they need to add MiniMax-M2.5, DeepSeek-V3.2, and Qwen3-235B-A22B to the providers configuration. \n\nFirst, I need to check if the current configuration already includes these models. But since the previous attempts to read the configuration files didn't return any data, maybe the files are empty or not accessible. \n\nThe user might not have the necessary permissions to read those files, or the files might not exist. Alternatively, the SCNet models might not be available in the current setup. \n\nI should suggest checking the configuration files manually and adding the models if they're not present. Also, mention that they might need to install the SCNet platform's API key and ensure the models are available. \n\nSince the user can't access the files directly, providing clear steps on how to modify the configuration and install the required models would be helpful. They might need to contact SCNet support or check their documentation for installation instructions.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n无法直接查看当前配置，但您可以手动添加以下模型到OpenClaw的providers配置中：\n\n1. MiniMax-M2.5\n2. DeepSeek-V3.2\n3. Qwen3-235B-A22B\n\n在OpenClaw的配置文件（通常位于`/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json`或`/etc/openclaw/config.yaml`）中，添加以下内容：\n\n```json\n\"providers\": {\n  \"scnet\": {\n    \"models\": [\n      \"MiniMax-M2.5\",\n      \"DeepSeek-V3.2\",\n      \"Qwen3-235B-A22B\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n或者通过OpenClaw CLI添加：\n```bash\nopenclaw config set providers.scnet.models \"MiniMax-M2.5,DeepSeek-V3.2,Qwen3-235B-A22B\"\n```\n\n添加后重启OpenClaw服务即可生效。需要确认SCNet平台的API密钥已正确配置在`~/.openclaw/openclaw.json`的`scnet`配置下。\n</final>"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/free","usage":{"in