{"type":"message","id":"3d9c86c8","parentId":"e35ab2c3","timestamp":"2026-03-29T07:22:35.662Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53b97d5850a0eeaab2e71329835\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 07:22 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53b97d5850a0eeaab2e71329835]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: \"baseUrl\": \"https://api.scnet.cn/api/llm/v1\",\n\"apiKey\": \"sk-NzY3LTEyMDcwMjI1MzMyLTE3NzQ2MTc5MTYwNzI=\",\n\"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n这些东西怎么设置的呢，\nopenclaw config set providers.scnet.models \"MiniMax-M2.5,DeepSeek-V3.2,Qwen3-235B-A22B\"\n这样一个命令设置不全吧"}],"timestamp":1774768955642}}
{"type":"message","id":"b9021329","parentId":"3d9c86c8","timestamp":"2026-03-29T07:22:56.959Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户问的是如何设置SCNet平台的配置。根据他们提供的配置信息：\n\n```\n\"local\": {\n\"baseUrl\": \"https://api.scnet.cn/api/llm/v1\",\n\"apiKey\": \"sk-NzY3LTEyMDcwMjI1MzMyLTE3NzQ2MTc5MTYwNzI=\",\n\"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n}\n```\n\n他们想要添加三个模型：MiniMax-M2.5, DeepSeek-V3.2, Qwen3-235B-A22B。\n\n根据OpenClaw的配置结构，providers配置应该是一个嵌套对象。用户说得对，\"openclaw config set providers.scnet.models \"MiniMax-M2.5,DeepSeek-V3.2,Qwen3-235B-A22B\"\" 这个命令可能不完整，因为它只设置了模型列表，但没有设置providers.scnet的其他必要字段（如baseUrl, apiKey, api）。\n\n我需要提供完整的配置步骤，包括：\n1. 如何设置providers.scnet的完整配置（baseUrl, apiKey, api）\n2. 如何在同一个配置中添加models列表\n\nOpenClaw config命令支持嵌套设置。正确的做法可能是：\n```\nopenclaw config set providers.scnet.baseUrl \"https://api.scnet.cn/api/llm/v1\"\nopenclaw config set providers.scnet.apiKey \"sk-NzY3LTEyMDcwMjI1MzMyLTE3NzQ2MTc5MTYwNzI=\"\nopenclaw config set providers.scnet.api \"openai-completions\"\nopenclaw config set providers.scnet.models \"MiniMax-M2.5,DeepSeek-V3.2,Qwen3-235B-A22B\"\n```\n\n或者一次性设置整个providers对象。\n\n让我更详细地解释一下。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"你说得对，那个命令确实不够完整。SCNet 是一个新的 provider，需要设置完整的配置结构。\n\n**正确的做法：**\n\n```bash\n# 1. 先设置 provider 的基础配置\nopenclaw config set providers.scnet.baseUrl \"https://api.scnet.cn/api/llm/v1\"\nopenclaw config set providers.scnet.apiKey \"sk-NzY3LTEyMDcwMjI1MzMyLTE3NzQ2MTc5MTYwNzI=\"\nopenclaw config set providers.scnet.api \"openai-completions\"\n\n# 2. 再设置支持的模型列表\nopenclaw config set providers.scnet.models \"MiniMax-M2.5,DeepSeek-V3.2,Qwen3-235B-A22B\"\n```\n\n或者，如果你想一次性设置整个 providers 对象，可以编辑配置文件：\n\n```bash\n# 编辑配置文件\nvim ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\n```\n\n在 `providers` 部分添加：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"providers\": {\n    ...已有配置,\n    \"scnet\": {\n      \"baseUrl\": \"https://api.scnet.cn/api/llm/v1\",\n      \"apiKey\": \"sk-NzY3LTEyMDcwMjI1MzMyLTE3NzQ2MTc5MTYwNzI=\",\n      \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n      \"models\": [\n        \"MiniMax-M2.5\",\n        \"DeepSeek-V3.2\",\n        \"Qwen3-235B-A22B\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**注意：**\n- 确保 `apiKey` 不要泄露\n- 设置完成后重启 OpenClaw：`openclaw restart`\n- 可以用 `openclaw config get providers` 验证配置\n\n这样模型和 provider 就完整配置好了。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/free","usage":{"input":28439,"output":1187,"cacheRead":768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30394,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774768955682,"responseId":"gen-1774768959-7JVJs6pjaWGDo1WUgwpf"}}
