{"type":"message","id":"6f1c546a","parentId":"001578b7","timestamp":"2026-03-29T07:31:58.056Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\nBased on the configuration checks, here's how to properly add SCNet models to your OpenClaw setup:\n\n**1. Create/Open Configuration File**\n```bash\n# Check if file exists\nls ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json 2>/dev/null || touch ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\n```\n\n**2. Add SCNet Provider Configuration**\nEdit `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` and add this structure:\n\n```json\n\"providers\": {\n  \"scnet\": {\n    \"baseUrl\": \"https://api.scnet.cn/api/llm/v1\",\n    \"apiKey\": \"sk-NzY3LTEyMDcwMjI1MzMyLTE3NzQ2MTc5MTYwNzI=\",\n    \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n    \"models\": [\n      \"MiniMax-M2.5\",\n      \"DeepSeek-V3.2\",\n      \"Qwen3-235B-A22B\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**3. Verify Configuration**\n```bash\ncat ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json | jq '.providers.scnet.models'\n# Should return: [\"MiniMax-M2.5\",\"DeepSeek-V3.2\",\"Qwen3-235B-A22B\"]\n```\n\n**4. Restart OpenClaw**\n```bash\nopenclaw restart\n```\n\n**5. Verify Model Availability**\n```bash\nopenclaw models list\n# Should show:\n# - MiniMax-M2.5\n# - DeepSeek-V3.2\n# - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n```\n\n**Common Issues & Fixes:**\n- **File Not Found:** Ensure you're editing the correct file (check for typos in path)\n- **JSON Syntax Errors:** Use `jq` to validate: `jq . ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json`\n- **API Key Issues:** Verify the key format matches SCNet's requirements\n- **Permissions:** Run `chmod 600 ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` if needed\n\nThe configuration should now be properly set up with all three SCNet models available for use.\n</final>"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/free","usage":{"input":36607,"output":461,"cacheRead":43,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37111,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReaso