{"type":"message","id":"7cb7868a","parentId":"062660e0","timestamp":"2026-03-29T08:38:40.615Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The other subagent that was supposed to read the original URL (PXQuwknRLikPzmkcKspjr4ufpKf) also failed with a 400 error. \n\nThe user provided the wrong URL. Let me check - they first gave:\n- https://ijpsec7x2d72.jp.larksuite.com/wiki/PXQuwknRLikPzmkcKspjr4ufpKf (ECHO protocol)\n- https://ijpsec7x2d72.jp.larksuite.com/wiki/BxImwCq5ni38yekUvLwjc3SQpzf (Q2 plan)\n\nThe first one (PXQuwknRLikPzmkcKspjr4ufpKf) was supposed to be the ECHO protocol document, but it seems to not be accessible or the token is wrong.\n\nThe second one (BxImwCq5ni38yekUvLwjc3SQpzf) was the Q2 plan that we successfully read.\n\nWait - maybe I should just ask the user for the correct document. The token might have changed or maybe the document was moved.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n读取另一个也出错了。**看起来那个 ECHO 协议文档的链接（PXQuwknRLikPzmkcKspjr4ufpKf）可能是错的或者已经失效了**。你现在给的链接是 BxImwCq5ni38yekUvLwjc3SQpzf，对应的是 \"2025年Q2整体计划\"。\n\n**能否再发一下正确的 ECHO 协议文档链接？** 确认是合约接口/API 文档那个。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774773499055,"responseId":"chatcmpl-fbadf12388c93127180d891385b900df"}}
