{"type":"message","id":"79d774d5","parentId":"b1146d85","timestamp":"2026-03-29T08:39:00.857Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The subagent is returning empty results again. This seems to be an issue with the Google Gemini model that was used for this task. Looking at the error message from the previous attempt, it shows \"400 status code (no body)\" which indicates the Google API is failing.\n\nThe user has been asking to read the ECHO protocol document. The original URL was:\nhttps://ijpsec7x2d72. jp. larksuite. com/ wiki/PXQuwknRLikPzmkcKspjr4ufpKf\n\nBut now the user gave a new URL:\nhttps://ijpsec7x2d72. jp. larksuite. com/ wiki/BxImwCq5ni38yekUvLwjc3SQpzf\n\nThat one worked but it was the wrong document - a Q2 2025 plan, not the ECHO protocol. The user needs to provide the correct URL for the ECHO protocol contract interface document.\n\nI should ask the user to provide the correct URL for the ECHO protocol document.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n两个任务的子代理都返回空结果（因为模型出错了）。之前成功读取的那个文档是\"2025年Q2整体计划\"，不是ECHO协议。\n\n看起来原始链接 PXQuwknRLikPzmkcKspjr4ufpKf 可能已失效或权限不足。\n\n**请再发一下正确的 ECHO 协议文档链接**，最好是合约接口/API 相关的那个。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774773520999,"responseId":"chatcmpl-47f15a64943714ab2665f3ddb46bbd5b"}}
