c9b\",\n        \"seq\": 137\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"The subagent ran successfully but still didn't return the document content - it only tried to read the skill files but those results were also empty. This confirms the feishu tools aren't returning content. \\n\\nI should now ask the user to share the ECHO protocol contract interfaces directly, since I can't access the document.\\n\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"\\n\\n子代理运行成功了，但仍然没有返回文档内容。这说明飞书工具确实无法获取你的文档内容。\\n\\n很抱歉，当前环境下飞书文档技能无法正常读取那个文档（可能是权限或网络问题）。**能否请你把 ECHO 协议文档里的核心接口信息直接发给我？**\\n\\n我需要了解：\\n\\n1. **合约的主要函数**（如 register、license、invoke、derive、分润等）\\n2. **关键的数据结构/事件**\\n3. **权限检查的流程**\\n4. **分润机制的具体规则**\\n5. **任何现有的 API 或 SDK 接口**\\n\\n拿到这些信息后，我就能马上设计详细的 Agent 集成方案和 React 项目结构。\\n\\n或者你可以：\\n- 导出文档内容为 Markdown/文本粘贴过来\\n- 截图关键章节发给我\\n\\n哪个方式方便就哪个。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.5\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1774772394671,\n      \"responseId\": \"chatcmpl-3e81ae303ba8a4f6f6b63b564224590a\",\n      \"__openclaw\": {\n        \"id\": \"c8d8a55d\",\n        \"seq\": 138\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 你要如何才能读取lark文档\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"timestamp\": 1774772661262,\n      \"__openclaw\": {\n        \"id\": \"e6a65b11\",\n        \"seq\": 139\n      },\n      \"senderLabel\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"The user is asking how I can read the Lark (Feishu) document. They want to understand what configuration or permissions are needed for me to access the document.\\n\\nLooking at what I've tried so far:\\n1. I've been using subagents with feishu-wiki and feishu-doc skills\\n2. The subagents can read the skill files but can't actually fetch the document content\\n3. The error seems to be that the tools aren't returning any content\\n\\nLet me think about what might be needed:\\n\\n1. **API Credentials**: The feishu tools might need Feishu API credentials (app_id and app_secret) to access documents\\n2. **Permissions**: The user might need to grant the app permission to read the specific document/space\\n3. **Network access**: The server might not have network access to Feishu's API\\n4. **Tool configuration**: The feishu skills might need to be configured with proper credentials\\n\\nLet me check the feishu skill files to understand what configuration is needed. I should try to read those skill files myself in this session to understand the requirements.\\n\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"\\n\\n让我看看飞书技能需要什么配置才能读取文档。让我直接读取飞书技能的配置说明：\\n\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"toolCall\",\n          \"id\": \"call_97e60f85f3224dbf9a89d972\",\n          \"name\": \"sessions_spawn\",\n          \"arguments\": {\n            \"task\": \"Read the following files to understand how to configure Feishu tools:\\n1. /app/extensions/feishu/feishu_bridge.yaml (if exists)\\n2. /app/extensions/feishu/config.yaml (if exists)\\n3. Any .env files in /app/extensions/feishu/\\n4. Also check the feishu-wiki and feishu-doc skill files for required configuration\\n\\nOutput the full contents of these files and identify what credentials/permissions are needed.\",\n            \"runtime\": \"subagent\",\n            \"mode\": \"run\",\n            \"model\": \"scnet/DeepSeek-V3.2\"\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n      \"provider\": \"scnet\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.5\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"toolUse\