{"type":"message","id":"2a052595","parentId":"8cb8659a","timestamp":"2026-03-29T09:01:04.066Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The issue persists - the subagent cannot use scnet models due to credential issues (510 Model Request Error). And openrouter has insufficient credits (402 error).We've tried many times and the issue is clear now:1. **Subagents cannot use scnet models** - the API key is not passed to them2. **Subagents cannot use openrouter** - insufficient credits\n3. **Subagents cannot use google gemini** - 400 error\n\nThe only thing that works in the main session is scnet/DeepSeek-2.5, but even that seems to have issues sometimes.Actually wait - the main session is using MiniMax-2.5 and it's working. The issue is specifically with subagents.\n\nGiven the repeated failures, I should tell the user that we cannot read the document from here and ask them to either:\n1. Paste the document content directly\n2. Provide a different access method\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n子代理一直失败。问题很清楚了：\n\n| 子代理尝试的模型 | 错误 |\n|-----------------|------|\n| scnet/DeepSeek-2 | 510 Model Request Error（凭证没传递） |\n| openrouter/auto | 402 余额不足 |\n| google/gemini | 400 错误 |\n\n**目前只有主会话可以正常工作（scnet/DeepSeek-2.5）。**\n\n---\n\n**能不能请你把文档内容直接粘贴给我？** 我可以直接在主会话中处理，不需要用子代理。这样最快。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774774842113,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ed9ae5f5d1dd4392a745e866f2076450"}}
